      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استعادهُ</span></b>  <i>He asked him to return.</i> (O, Msb,
K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استعادهُ الشَّىْءَ</span> <i>He asked him to repeat
the thing; to do it a second time:</i> (S, O, Msb,
K:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استعادهُ مِنْهُ</span> [<i>He asked for the repetition
of it from him</i>]. (Har p. 28.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also 8.

